..and The Naturalist in Rhino Form with Indomitable Force has the same -2 DR. &nbsp;Add a Resilient Hide and he auto-heals every round. &nbsp;Nice thing about Human Shield is that it stays round after round, rather than being a disappearing Ongoing&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;To be fair, my most favorite tank is Scholar with two Flesh to Irons and a Take What You Need out. &nbsp;A massive -4 DR, plus all the card draw necessary to fuel the Flesh to Irons, will usually be the highest-hero HP (so will soak up the damage intended for highest-HP heroes), and enough card-draw/deck-shuffling options to be able to find/use/re-use his damage-redirect cards.
